WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.400
Hello sir, I am very happy
to share my experience

00:00:03.400 --> 00:00:06.360
with Global English Guru.

00:00:06.360 --> 00:00:10.800
Before joining the classes, I was
not very confident in speaking English.

00:00:10.800 --> 00:00:15.280
I had many thoughts, but sometimes
I was afraid to express them.

00:00:15.280 --> 00:00:19.000
Your classes helped me speak
without being afraid of mistakes.

00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:25.680
With regular practice and your guidance,
I can see a big change in my confidence.

00:00:25.680 --> 00:00:28.320
I feel much more comfortable speaking now.

00:00:28.320 --> 00:00:29.840
Thank you so much, sir.

00:00:29.840 --> 00:00:31.920
You didn’t just teach me English.

00:00:31.920 --> 00:00:35.360
You gave me the confidence
to express myself.

00:00:35.360 --> 00:00:36.560
Thank you so much.
